    "turn_text": "on this or that or not, he proved that you can now run a big, credible, potentially successful campaign without any special interest contributions or big fat cat donors just by reaching out to individuals on the internet. And if that model can take hold, then we can revivify the dream of our founders and make American democracy work again.",
