    "turn_idx": 256,
    "turn_text": "No, but it's not. But when you have a demagogue who comes in and says, I'll take you back to the good old days, we'll recreate the past. We're going to go back to the age of coal. We're not going back to the age of coal. The market capitalization of the coal industry in this country has gone down almost 90% in the last decade.",
